{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o175a","title":"曹操攻屠窦茂","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o175a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操出散关到河池，窦茂恃险拒守；五月曹军攻屠之。","evidence":["wudi-e-o175a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"进攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o175a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0341","role":"拒守被破","evidence":["wudi-e-o175a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"散关、河池","evidence":["wudi-e-o175a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十年夏四月至五月","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o175a-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年夏四月至五月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,997,"O175a"],"order":371},{"id":"zhangle-e-o031a","title":"张郃讨窦茂率兵通路","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o031a-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张郃讨窦茂率兵通路","evidence":["zhangle-e-o031a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"督军","evidence":["zhangle-e-o031a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0341","role":"被讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o031a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"征汉中后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o031a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o031a-q","source_order":[17,104,"O031a"],"order":3549}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0341","name":"窦茂","evidence":["wudi-q-o175","zhangle-q-o031"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o175-wudi-p0341","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o175"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o031-wudi-p0341","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o031"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o175a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-010b7223a46bf940739c","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，公自陈仓以出散关〖8〗，至河池〖9〗。氐王窦茂，众万余人，恃险不服。五月，公攻屠之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"wudi-q-o175","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-010b7223a46bf940739c","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，公自陈仓以出散关〖8〗，至河池〖9〗。氐王窦茂，众万余人，恃险不服。五月，公攻屠之。西平、金城诸将麴演、蒋石等，共斩送韩遂首。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":70},{"id":"zhangle-e-o031a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-9660463527d31e82b011","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征张鲁，先遣郃督诸军讨兴和氐王窦茂〖5〗。太祖从散关入汉中，又先遣郃督步卒五千，于前通路。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"zhangle-q-o031","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-9660463527d31e82b011","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征张鲁，先遣郃督诸军讨兴和氐王窦茂〖5〗。太祖从散关入汉中，又先遣郃督步卒五千，于前通路。至阳平〖6〗，鲁降。太祖还，留郃与夏侯渊等守汉中，拒刘备。郃别督诸军，降巴东、巴西二郡〖7〗，徙其民于汉中。进军宕渠〖8〗，为备将张飞所拒，引还南郑。拜荡寇将军。刘备屯阳平，郃屯广石〖9〗。备以精卒万余，分为十部，夜急攻郃；郃率亲兵搏战，备不能克。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":171}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
